# Personal data must never be committed.
#
# The skill keeps your resume, career context, and past answers in a workspace
# outside this repo (~/job-application-answers/ by default). These rules are a
# second line of defense in case anything lands here by accident.

profile/
answers/
workspace/

# Resume / personal documents in any form
*resume*
*résumé*
*cv*
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc

# Common accidents
context.md
my-*.md
draft*.md
*-answer.md
*.local.md

.DS_Store
